concept:australian-human-rights-commission-amendment-national-children-s-commissioner-act-2012-sch-1-sec-46mb-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "46MB(3) Functions of Commission that are to be performed by"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-46mb-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) A report under paragraph (1)(a):  (a) must deal with such matters, relating to the enjoyment and exercise of human rights by children in Australia, as the National Children’s Commissioner considers appropriate; and  (b) may include recommendations that the Commissioner considers appropriate as to the action that should be taken to ensure the enjoyment and exercise of human rights by children in Australia." ;
    skos:definition "(3) A report under paragraph (1)(a):  (a) must deal with such matters, relating to the enjoyment and exercise of human rights by children in Australia, as the National Children’s Commissioner considers appropriate; and  (b) may include recommendations that the Commissioner considers appropriate as to the action that should be taken to ensure the enjoyment and exercise of human rights by children in Australia."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "8d37f5c088f5cf433dfccfdef71ff7efc1c0205cfa9977da3c8c34afe014794d" ;
    values:partOf concept:australian-human-rights-commission-amendment-national-children-s-commissioner-act-2012-sch-1-sec-46mb ;
    cof:pageNumber "8"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Commissioner must deal with matters relating to human rights of children in Australia." ;
