concept:australian-human-rights-commission-amendment-national-children-s-commissioner-act-2012-sch-1-sec-46mb-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "46MB(6) Functions of Commission that are to be performed by"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-46mb-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) In performing functions under this section, the National Children’s Commissioner must, as appropriate, have regard to:  (a) the Universal Declaration of Human Rights (United Nations General Assembly Resolution A/RES/217(III) A (1948); and  (b) the following, as amended and in force for Australia from time to time:  (i) the International Convention on the Elimination of all Forms of Racial Discrimination done at New York on" ;
    skos:definition "(6) In performing functions under this section, the National Children’s Commissioner must, as appropriate, have regard to:  (a) the Universal Declaration of Human Rights (United Nations General Assembly Resolution A/RES/217(III) A (1948); and  (b) the following, as amended and in force for Australia from time to time:  (i) the International Convention on the Elimination of all Forms of Racial Discrimination done at New York on"@en ;
