concept:australian-human-rights-commission-amendment-national-children-s-commissioner-act-2012-sch-1-sec-18 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "18 December 1979 ([1983] ATS 9);"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-18 ;
    values:originalText "(v) the Convention on the Rights of the Child done at New York on 20 November 1989 ([1991] ATS 4);  (vi) the Convention on the Rights of Persons with Disabilities done at New York on 13 December 2006 ([2008] ATS 12); and  (c) such other instruments relating to human rights as the Commissioner considers relevant. Note 1: In 2012, the text of the Universal Declaration of Human Rights was accessible through the United Nations website (www.un.org). Note 2: In 2012, the text of an international agreement in the Australian Treaty Series was accessible through the Australian Treaties Library on the AustLII website (www.austlii.edu.au). ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00089  Schedule 1  National Children’s Commissioner" ;
    skos:definition "(v) the Convention on the Rights of the Child done at New York on 20 November 1989 ([1991] ATS 4);  (vi) the Convention on the Rights of Persons with Disabilities done at New York on 13 December 2006 ([2008] ATS 12); and  (c) such other instruments relating to human rights as the Commissioner considers relevant. Note 1: In 2012, the text of the Universal Declaration of Human Rights was accessible through the United Nations website (www.un.org). Note 2: In 2012, the text of an international agreement in the Australian Treaty Series was accessible through the Australian Treaties Library on the AustLII website (www.austlii.edu.au). ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00089  Schedule 1  National Children’s Commissioner"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "ee43fe869ca726df7492e5db88db3e66cee8d6fcff08a0475ece6ec8e5e8db1f" ;
    cof:pageNumber "9"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "List of human rights instruments relevant to the Australian Treaty Series" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <australian-human-rights-commission-amendment-national-children-s-commissioner-act-2012.pdf> ;
