concept:australian-human-rights-commission-amendment-national-children-s-commissioner-act-2012-sch-1-sec-46mc a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "46MC Appointment of National Children’s Commissioner"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-46mc ;
    values:originalText "(1) The National Children’s Commissioner is to be appointed by the Governor-General by written instrument, on a full-time basis.  (2) A person must not be appointed as the National Children’s Commissioner unless the Minister is satisfied that the person has appropriate qualifications, knowledge or experience." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The National Children’s Commissioner is to be appointed by the Governor-General by written instrument, on a full-time basis.  (2) A person must not be appointed as the National Children’s Commissioner unless the Minister is satisfied that the person has appropriate qualifications, knowledge or experience."@en ;
