concept:australian-human-rights-commission-amendment-national-children-s-commissioner-act-2012-sch-1-sec-46md a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "46MD Period of appointment"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-46md ;
    values:originalText "The National Children’s Commissioner holds office for the period specified in the instrument of appointment. The period must not exceed 7 years. Note: For re-appointment, see section 33AA of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901." ;
    skos:definition "The National Children’s Commissioner holds office for the period specified in the instrument of appointment. The period must not exceed 7 years. Note: For re-appointment, see section 33AA of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901."@en ;
