    cof:title "46MG(2) Leave of absence" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) The Minister may grant the National Children’s Commissioner leave of absence, other than recreation leave, on the terms and conditions as to remuneration or otherwise that the Minister determines." ;
