    skos:prefLabel "46MI Resignation"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-46mi ;
    values:originalText "(1) The National Children’s Commissioner may resign his or her appointment by giving the Governor-General a written resignation.  (2) The resignation takes effect on the day it is received by the Governor-General or, if a later day is specified in the resignation, on that later day." ;
