    skos:prefLabel "7 First report of the National Children’s Commissioner"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-7 ;
    values:originalText "The first report under paragraph 46MB(1)(a) of the Australian Human Rights Commission Act 1986 (as amended by this Act) is to be submitted to the Minister as soon as practicable after 30 June 2013." ;
