concept:australian-human-rights-commission-amendment-national-children-s-commissioner-act-2012-sch-1-sec-8-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "8 Application of amendment made by item 6"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-8-2 ;
    values:originalText "The amendment made by item 6 applies in relation to proceedings:  (a) that commence on or after the commencement of that item; or  (b) that commenced before the commencement of that item, and that had not been completed by that commencement.  [Minister’s second reading speech made in— House of Representatives on 23 May 2012 Senate on 21 June 2012]  (79/12) ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00089" ;
    skos:definition "The amendment made by item 6 applies in relation to proceedings:  (a) that commence on or after the commencement of that item; or  (b) that commenced before the commencement of that item, and that had not been completed by that commencement.  [Minister’s second reading speech made in— House of Representatives on 23 May 2012 Senate on 21 June 2012]  (79/12) ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00089"@en ;
